<title>INDIA: India Bajaj sees 97/98 exports at 2.0 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>India Bajaj sees 97/98 exports at 2.0 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scooter major Bajaj Auto Ltd chairman said on Wednesday the firm has set an export target of 2.0 billion rupees for 1997/98 (April-March).  </p>
<p>The firm said exports fell to 1.58 billion rupees in 1996/97 from 1.89 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
